s="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-0.5 line-clamp-1">Open a support ticket</div></div><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><main><section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 via-white to-gray-50 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, rgba(0,0,0,0.08) 1px, transparent 0);background-size:32px 32px"></div></div><div class="absolute top-20 right-1/4 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-gold/5 to-orange-200/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div><div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8"><a class="hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors" href="/">Home</a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><a class="hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors" href="/listing">Listing</a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="text-gray-900">Listing Process</span></div><div class="max-w-3xl"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-white rounded-full border border-gray-200 shadow-sm mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"></path><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg><span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Get Started</span></div><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-light text-gray-900 leading-tight tracking-tight mb-6">Your Path to<!-- --> <span class="font-semibold bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-brand-gold bg-clip-text text-transparent">Listing on MERJ</span></h1><p class="text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">When you&#x27;re ready to execute your plans and share your vision with the world, we&#x27;re here to guide you through every step of the listing journey.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a class="btn-primary group" href="/apply">Start Your Application<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-5 h-5 ml-2 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="btn-secondary" href="/listing/ways-to-list">Explore Listing Options</a></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12 border-y border-gray-100 bg-white"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8"><div class="text-center"><div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-gray-900 mb-2 tracking-tight">7<span class="text-brand-gold"> Days</span></div><div class="text-gray-500 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Initial Response</div></div><div class="text-center"><div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-gray-900 mb-2 tracking-tight">5</div><div class="text-gray-500 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Simple Steps</div></div><div class="text-center"><div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-gray-900 mb-2 tracking-tight">3</div><div class="text-gray-500 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Market Boards</div></div><div class="text-center"><div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-gray-900 mb-2 tracking-tight">135<span class="text-brand-gold">+</span></div><div class="text-gray-500 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Jurisdictions</div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 bg-white"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-16"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-gray-100 rounded-full text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-column w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg>The Listing Process</div><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light text-gray-900 mb-6 tracking-tight">Five Steps to<!-- --> <span class="font-semibold">Go Public</span></h2><p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Once we receive your completed application with the application fee, our team will review and respond within 7 days. A dedicated team member will guide you through each step.</p></div><div class="space-y-0"><div class="relative flex gap-6"><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl shadow-lg relative z-10">1</div><div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-300 to-gray-100 mt-4"></div></div><div class="flex-1 pb-12"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 hover:border-gray-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:from-brand-gold/10 group-hover:to-orange-50 transition-all duration-300"><div class="text-gray-600 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z"></path><path d="M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"></path><path d="M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"></path><path d="M10 6h4"></path><path d="M10 10h4"></path><path d="M10 14h4"></path><path d="M10 18h4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Choose Your Market and Way to List</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Select the market board that best fits your company&#x27;s profile and choose between a primary listing, transfer listing, or dual listing option.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative flex gap-6"><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl shadow-lg relative z-10">2</div><div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-300 to-gray-100 mt-4"></div></div><div class="flex-1 pb-12"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 hover:border-gray-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:from-brand-gold/10 group-hover:to-orange-50 transition-all duration-300"><div class="text-gray-600 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"></path><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg></div></div><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Reserve Your Ticker Symbol</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Secure your unique trading symbol that will represent your company on the exchange. This becomes your market identity.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative flex gap-6"><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl shadow-lg relative z-10">3</div><div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-300 to-gray-100 mt-4"></div></div><div class="flex-1 pb-12"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 hover:border-gray-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:from-brand-gold/10 group-hover:to-orange-50 transition-all duration-300"><div class="text-gray-600 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg></div></div><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Choose Your Advisors</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Select from our network of approved Sponsor Advisors who will guide you through the regulatory and compliance requirements.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative flex gap-6"><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl shadow-lg relative z-10">4</div><div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-300 to-gray-100 mt-4"></div></div><div class="flex-1 pb-12"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 hover:border-gray-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:from-brand-gold/10 group-hover:to-orange-50 transition-all duration-300"><div class="text-gray-600 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-send w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"></path><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"></path></svg></div></div><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Submit the Listing Application</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Complete and submit your formal listing application with all required documentation and the application fee.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative flex gap-6"><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl shadow-lg relative z-10">5</div></div><div class="flex-1 pb-12"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 hover:border-gray-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:from-brand-gold/10 group-hover:to-orange-50 transition-all duration-300"><div class="text-gray-600 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-briefcase w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="6" rx="2"></rect></svg></div></div><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Appoint a Designated Broker</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Optionally select a designated broker to provide liquidity and market-making services for your listed securities.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-8 text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center text-gray-900 font-medium hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors group" href="/listing/sponsor-advisors">View Our Sponsor Advisors<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 ml-2 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-50 to-white"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-16"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-white rounded-full border border-gray-200 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg>Choose Your Market</div><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light text-gray-900 mb-6 tracking-tight">Market Boards for<!-- --> <span class="font-semibold">Every Stage</span></h2><p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">We offer different markets for different types and sizes of companies. Choose the board that matches your company&#x27;s profile and listing requirements.</p></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="group relative bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-gray-300 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl"><div class="h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-gold via-orange-400 to-orange-600 opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div><div class="p-8"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"><div class="text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z"></path><path d="M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"></path><path d="M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"></path><path d="M10 6h4"></path><path d="M10 10h4"></path><path d="M10 14h4"></path><path d="M10 18h4"></path></svg></div></div><span class="px-3 py-1 bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold text-xs font-medium rounded-full">Established Companies</span></div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Main Board</h3><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">For established global issuers with proven track records and comprehensive financial histories.</p><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>3+ years operating history</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>3 years audited financials</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Investment funds &amp; SPACs</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Full regulatory oversight</li></ul></div></div><div class="group relative bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-gray-300 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl"><div class="h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-gold via-orange-400 to-orange-600 opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div><div class="p-8"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"><div class="text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg></div></div><span class="px-3 py-1 bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold text-xs font-medium rounded-full">Growth Companies</span></div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">SME Board</h3><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Designed for growing small to medium enterprises looking to access global capital markets.</p><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>1+ year operating history</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>1 year audited financials</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Fast-growing businesses</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Global investor appeal</li></ul></div></div><div class="group relative bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-gray-300 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl"><div class="h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-gold via-orange-400 to-orange-600 opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div><div class="p-8"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"><div class="text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rocket w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z"></path><path d="m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z"></path><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0"></path><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"></path></svg></div></div><span class="px-3 py-1 bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold text-xs font-medium rounded-full">Startups</span></div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">VCAP Board</h3><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">For early-stage startups with high growth potential seeking venture capital and investor access.</p><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Pre-revenue accepted</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>High growth potential</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Escrow fund protection</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Milestone-based releases</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="mt-12 text-center"><a class="btn-secondary" href="/listing/compare-markets">Compare All Markets<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right w-5 h-5 ml-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="py-16 bg-white border-y border-gray-100"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-8 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text w-6 h-6 text-white" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"></path><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Debt Market</h3><p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">List bonds and other debt instruments on our dedicated Debt Market with specialized regulatory framework.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center text-brand-gold font-medium hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors" href="/assets/debt">Learn More <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 ml-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-8 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-column w-6 h-6 text-white" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">ETP Market</h3><p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">List Exchange Traded Products including ETCs and ETNs on our specialized ETP Market.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center text-brand-gold font-medium hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors" href="/assets/etps">Learn More <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 ml-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 1px, transparent 0);background-size:40px 40px"></div></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div><div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light text-white mb-6 tracking-tight">Why List on<!-- --> <span class="font-semibold text-brand-gold">MERJ Exchange?</span></h2><p class="text-xl text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Access global capital markets with a regulated, efficient, and cost-effective listing process.</p></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8"><div class="text-center group"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 group-hover:bg-white/20 transition-all duration-300 border border-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock w-7 h-7 text-brand-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></div><h4 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Fast Turnaround</h4><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">7-day initial response with dedicated support throughout</p></div><div class="text-center group"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 group-hover:bg-white/20 transition-all duration-300 border border-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe w-7 h-7 text-brand-gold" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></div><h4 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Global Reach</h4><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Access investors from 180+ countries worldwide</p></div><div class="text-center group"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 group-hover:bg-white/20 transition-all duration-300 border border-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-7 h-7 text-brand-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></div><h4 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Fully Regulated</h4><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">FSA licensed, IOSCO-compliant market structure</p></div><div class="text-center group"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 group-hover:bg-white/20 transition-all duration-300 border border-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-7 h-7 text-brand-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg></div><h4 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Cost Effective</h4><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Competitive fee structure with transparent pricing</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-100 via-gray-50 to-white overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-40"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 1px, transparent 0);background-size:24px 24px"></div></div><div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold rounded-full text-sm font-medium mb-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="no